[{"client_msg_id":"1704e934-9afd-4124-8d96-8e9772146fc6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"データ記述言語を見ているみたい","ts":"1629642978.119900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"St1B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c60dffca-5756-496d-aa86-b4e94a4e937c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"へぇ","ts":"1629642931.119800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HgGFE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c04fe231-9a67-4239-8e29-7c439b1350cb","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"キーワード引数という観点では、 Lua の関数呼び出しの文法が面白くて。\nLua には直接の「キーワード引数を用いた関数呼び出し」の記法はありません。\nその代わり、（通常は `f(a)`みたいに普通に丸括弧をつけて呼び出すんですが）関数の引数が1つだけ + それがテーブル（Python の list と dict を一緒くたにしたようなデータ構造）のリテラルのときは丸括弧を省略できるんですよね。\nその場合 `f{foo = 1, bar = {1, 2}}` みたいな見た目になって、なんだか Python のキーワード引数みたいに渡せるという。（同様の文法で可変長引数もOK）","ts":"1629642838.119400","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1629642886.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yjF61"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2e10f33-ab2e-4efd-994d-a45be0c313f1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"辞書渡しでなんとかなってしまうせいか全然別の言語で見ない","ts":"1629639490.115500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ak9b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8732f34e-16e7-40f5-93a0-df5acbc19162","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ふとキーワード引数って中々ユニークな言語機能だよなって思った","ts":"1629639435.115400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dah57"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac9c8771-383f-4b00-828b-cd178e897396","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0634/#irrefutable-case-blocks\u003e\n\n\u0026gt; A match statement may have at most one irrefutable case block, and it must be last.\n最後に置いとけよという指示しかない。","ts":"1629607005.114500","attachments":[{"fallback":"Python.org: PEP 634 -- Structural Pattern Matching: Specification","id":1,"title":"PEP 634 -- Structural Pattern Matching: Specification","title_link":"https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0634/#irrefutable-case-blocks","text":"The official home of the Python Programming Language","thumb_url":"https://www.python.org/static/opengraph-icon-200x200.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Python.org","service_icon":"https://www.python.org/static/apple-touch-icon-precomposed.png","thumb_width":200,"thumb_height":200,"from_url":"https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0634/#irrefutable-case-blocks","original_url":"https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0634/#irrefutable-case-blocks"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"89hZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0cde8da2-b0b0-4f6b-96a7-f629579cf31f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あ、いやmatchにそもそも「どれかのcaseに必ずマッチしなければならない」という制約がないようでしたということです。","ts":"1629606807.113900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GLL9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08703701-8b97-4d90-b548-dad66b07eaa0","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Python の型アノテーションは実行時には特に意味がなかった気がするので、チェックが行われるとしても mypy などによる静的解析のときだけでしょうね。","ts":"1629606122.113700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QDR"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"動いた動いたと思ったら、そもそも出尽くしチェックをしてないっぽかった (rc1では)","ts":"1629605719.113000","files":[{"id":"F02BV9YCT1T","created":1629605688,"timestamp":1629605688,"name":"Screenshot_2021-08-22_13-14-42.png","title":"Screenshot_2021-08-22_13-14-42.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":23506,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02BV9YCT1T/screensho