","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"でも色々動いてくれなかったので、ultisnipsを直で使ってPython書かざるを得なくなった感じですね・・・","ts":"1629601461.106700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/G48"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3469fe6b-eb05-4138-a14e-262f846ff8b5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"すごい","ts":"1629601423.106100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yU+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa2f131e-07b2-49fa-b279-beac5b0bf0ce","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これを再現するためにcoc-snippetsが中でexecutePythonみたいなことをやっててヤバいなってなってた","ts":"1629601401.105900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2opMZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2626efa5-a59c-4339-aaec-1de9fcff7ef3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"いずれにせよUltiSnips専用になるんですよね、だとしたらPythonで書くかな","ts":"1629601346.105400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nwRTl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80877d8e-9f33-430c-9060-733df27c9526","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Vim scriptで書くよりはPythonで書いといた方がよさそうだけどどうなんだろう","ts":"1629601296.105000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XTN72"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3dabe326-8509-4c52-8eee-fe490af06f1a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"昨日か一昨日に書いたやつ\n```global !p\ndef parse_props(args):\n\tprop_names = []\n\tfor line in args.split(\"\\n\"):\n\t\tarr = line.split(\":\")\n\t\tif len(arr) == 0:\n\t\t\tcontinue\n\t\tprop_names.append(arr[0].lstrip())\n\n\treturn ', '.join(prop_names)\nendglobal\n\nsnippet fc \"React Functional Component\"\ntype ${1}Props = {\n\t${2:props}\n}\n\nconst ${3:Component}: FC\u0026lt;${1/\\w+/$0/}Props\u0026gt; = ({ `!p snip.rv = parse_props(t[2])` }) =\u0026gt; {\n\treturn \u0026lt;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/\u0026gt;\n}\nendsnippet```","ts":"1629601270.104600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xJi93"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bdf7b0e-c6bd-44af-b264-6044d871e791","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そういえばultisnipsを使い始めてPythonを書かざるを得なくなってしまって難しい","ts":"1629601235.104300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rMqq2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27823508-9e85-4502-92ee-2d886bcefb02","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Python だと型アノテーションが付いていても、実行時に本当にその型が入るとは保証されませんからね―…\n```def foo(b: bool) -\u0026gt; int:\n    match b:\n        case True:\n            return 1;\n        case False:\n            return 0;```\nこういうのは \"exhausted\" なんだろうか","ts":"1629600639.103500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QKj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7c13e56-3a8b-4219-a1d1-67a67666dc8a","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ちなみにrubyのはパターンで尽くしチェックはとくになさそうです\n```class CParent\nend\n\nclass C1 \u0026lt; CParent\nend\n\nclass C2 \u0026lt; CParent\nend\n\nclass C3 \u0026lt; CParent\nend\n\n\ncase C1.new\nin C1 =\u0026gt; c\n  p [1, c]\nin C2 =\u0026gt; c\n  p [2, c]\nend```\nこれでノーエラー。ただRBSでいろいろやればなんかできるかもしれない","ts":"1629600638.103200","edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1629600670.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xeZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6e17ce7-e39f-4c32-bd45-de026342a8e5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"cdadarみたいなの無限に書いてると脳がバグる","ts":"1629600627.102900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VETZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9479f13-2c91-493f-80d9-5843e6ececef","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Lispだとほぼ全てリストで扱う関係上とても複雑な構造を扱うことが多かったので助かっていたな、パターンマッチによる分解は","ts":"1629600590.101400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TE6f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2cdef48-3d90-4913-9415-4fe4bcfb3229","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"実用上動的でもそれが行われるならかなりうれしいところ","ts":"1629600525.099400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k/S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2487f71-b7c7-4a52-a8f8-c8ebff77d928","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"でもって実行時型付けの言語だとそもそも任意のチェックを静的に行えないので、やるとしたら動的になるはずです","ts":"1629600484.098700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uFQZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53b61272-3221-4201-864e-1727200c2bc0","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"あの機能めっちゃうれしいですよね、あと、unreachableなやつの検出も。","ts":"1629600431.097400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iT=t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f9b88bb-c949-43a4-a599-e22780d6a808","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"静的型付けの言語だと「パターンが尽くされているかのチェック」を静的に行ってくれるイメージですが（といっても Rust ぐらいしか知らない）、 Python だとどうなるんだろう。 mypy がどの程度やってくれるのか","ts":"1629600396.096700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/xx7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c85ebf8d-be2f-4650-bf31-08662e391f0a","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですです","ts":"1629600312.095300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qh7D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b523acc-39ae-44b3-b553-b05b9fb18f34","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"TSの場合は型解析が強すぎてkindで無理矢理どうにかなっている感がすごい","ts":"1629600302.095000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RdgU7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1ab312f-ddeb-4857-a6ac-0f45a7e42ffa","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あれ、これってパターンマッチの構文であってます？","ts":"1629600270.094400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qBfeD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"444e84cc-e153-4615-9ebe-962ccf08660f","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"実際、Python のパターンマッチ記法と mypy のような静的型検査システムとの相性はかなり気になっているところです","ts":"1629600269.094300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l4Au"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0075521-e5cc-4c6a-8fa8-a821a7022a81","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"```{a: 1, b: 2, c: 3} in {a:, b:, c:}\np a```","ts":"1629600254.093600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XCLy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d12716c1-1d1e-4bea-991f-d078baf8cd3d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あくまで検査用のアノテーションでしかない","ts":"1629600251.093300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zuIiQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e48c048-5603-46dd-8364-3a32ad7237a8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あー、パターンマッチで分解できるのか","ts":"1629600251.093200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8D1Gg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5fadb34-7a35-431a-8de7-254dd8b91830","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"原理的に仕方ないと思う(Pythonにもmypyあるけど同じ問題を孕んでいると思う)","ts":"1629600231.092700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dBX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62d08afb-7343-457c-b5e1-2c5f92910615","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"```case {a: 1, b: 2, c: 3}\nin {a:, b:, c:}\n  p a\nend```","ts":"1629600229.092500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D+r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0dfa6c8b-3d0c-4491-ac69-75645297498a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u0026gt; こういう観点から見るとJSで型見るのと大差ない\nこれがTSの限界ですよね","ts":"1629600206.092000","team":"T03C4RC8V","r