079000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OsYex"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1c482cb-f6cc-49cb-8ea9-66f2eb60f20d","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"本質的には部分的に束縛できることかな","ts":"1629599876.078300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bvF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8be03b9c-bd3e-44d0-89c5-f37293a6dac9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"構造を分解するやつを雰囲気でパターンマッチングと呼んでいる","ts":"1629599864.077900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zbo5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0f9eecd-15d5-497d-a2b4-d4f59c8bc749","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"TSにクソ強力なパターンマッチ実装して欲しい","ts":"1629599835.076900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rhL8m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0da09d40-d25f-4e67-82f0-b0fe6315b3c4","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"そういえば、パターンマッチングは好きだけど「どういう性質を持っていたらパターンマッチングと呼べるのか」はあまり理解できていない…\n「値にマッチするか」ではなく「型の構造にマッチするか」を見ていたらパターンマッチっぽいな、みたいな漠然としたイメージがありますが\n（たとえばタプルや構造体を分解できるとか）","ts":"1629599793.076300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rtv2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65e47b2e-b7e8-42bd-864d-6cd6748c75f6","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ruby 2.7からのあれはほんとうにとても良いですね、elixirのあれと同様に","ts":"1629599246.073800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ynG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b02c9d98-4679-4822-96c8-9edccc976180","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ただ実際にはどの程度のちからをもっているかは結構言語によります。clojureのそれはruby 2.7以前のcase whenに比較的近いものでしたし","ts":"1629599208.073100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":